  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/b7b71fcbd8bc982dfd7b31b851ee352e5355d24b.png\" alt=\"Title\"> 来自 MBCMechachu 的 Cobblemon 图标，适用于 Xaero 小地图！</p>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/bd65a01d7a2db0de69f4c440a2c3724012cff6cd.png\" alt=\"shinyMark\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>包含未标记的闪光版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/f8c9f4a61e380e52553d7c79cf8707c1a7e26cd6.png\" alt=\"cosmetics\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f45NQR5l\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">完整外观列表</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/8db192c9d54be8f2f7d8ba8b5b4d14fd2efda818.png\" alt=\"speciesVariety\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持所有 Cobblemon 形态变化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/a4d77bf9445015c7055da9217a6c9df0b4ffd3a4.png\" alt=\"addonSupport\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持的附加组件列表。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><strong>官方</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcombee-mc-remodel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combee MC 重新建模</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fvivillon-pride-patterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vivillon 骄傲图案</a></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>虚构宝可梦</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-alatias-fakemon-pack-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alatia 的虚构宝可梦包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Pok&eacute;mon 扩展</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fallthemons\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fallthemons-x-mega-showdown-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons x Mega Showdown</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/radiants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AllTheMons x Mega Showdown Radiants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alphabet-soup\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alphabet Soup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ascension-megamons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascension Megamons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbaby-legends-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baby Legends</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcloudmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">CloudMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobble-cats\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleCats</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobbled-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobbled Variants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/cobblecafe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon Cafe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-exploration-day\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Exploration Day</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-mc-swords-for-honedge-line\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: MC Swords for Honedge Line</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mega-showdown\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon: Mega Showdown</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcolorable-forretress-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colorable Forretress Shulker Boxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-eternal-floette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Floette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fflower-expansion-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flower Expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgenomons\" rel=\"nofollow\">GenoMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgholdengo-shiny-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gholdengo 闪光修复</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhiddenmons-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">HiddenMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhydro-reanimodel-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hydro 的 Reanimodel 包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fkales-cobblemon-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kale 的合集</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">LackingMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/official-missingmons-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">MissingMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmoremons\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmundialmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MundialMons ReaniPack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmysticmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">MysticMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnavas-zamega\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Navas 的 ZAmega</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnotsocobblemon-allones-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotSoCobblemon Allone 的附加内容</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fodysseymons\" rel=\"nofollow\">OdysseyMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpigeons-poke-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pigeon 的 PokePack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobblemon-pokemans\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pokemans 包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252frotom-appliances\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rotom 电器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsaltmons\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltMons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fthe-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Jewel Pokemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftorterras-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torterras O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwavimons-(cobblemon)\" rel=\"nofollow\">WaviMons</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/00013aeb6299b53acfa5f602d74297b7bc20b9c1.png\" alt=\"bigIconVersion\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>大图标版本即将推出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>指南</h2>\n<p><strong>保持实体图标可见</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>进入你的世界并按下 \"Y\" 键打开 \"小地图设置\"。</li>\n<li>选择 \"实体雷达设置\"。</li>\n<li>将 \"显示图标\" 更改为 \"始终\"。</li>\n<li>调整 \"实体图标缩放\" 到你觉得合适的大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>仅显示 Pok&eacute;mon 图标</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>进入 .minecraft/config/xaero/minimap 文件夹并打开 \"default_radar_categories_client.json\"。</li>\n<li>将 <code>\"hardInclude\": \"anything\"</code> 替换为 <code>\"hardInclude\": \"nothing\"</code></li>\n<li>将 <code>\"includeList\": []</code> 替换为 <code>\"includeList\": [\"cobblemon:pokemon\"]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>与其他包配合使用</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcombee-mc-remodel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combee MC 重新建模</a> 应放置在此包之上。</li>\n<li>所有其他包应放置在此包之下。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BBCSgkwA/images/aae9bf9d71bdbcbc9af8e0f2b39437ab23838844.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"816\"></p>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>大多数 Pok&eacute;mon 精灵图来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.deviantart.com%252fmbcmechachu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MBCMechachu</a>。</li>\n<li>新朱紫 DLC 的 Pok&eacute;mon 精灵图来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.deviantart.com%252fezerart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ezerart</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>如果发现任何错误或遗漏的 Pok&eacute;mon，请在评论区留言！ :)</code></p>",
